  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "空間織品設計",
    "sub_ename": "APPLICATION OF TEXTILES DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "纖維藝術與織品設計是二十世紀初以降設計教育中重要的一環，它是結構、材質與色彩的遊戲，也是地方風土、傳統文化與科學技術的表徵。",
    "describe_eh": "Fiber art and fabric design is an important part of the design education in the early 20th century. It is a game of structure, material and color, and also a representation of local terroir, traditional culture and science and technology.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
